      "id": "2074916560041349120",
      "title": "My GPT-5.6 Review: Second Place Has Never Been This Good",
      "preview_text": "TL;DR\n- I have been testing GPT-5.6 since May 27. For the first two weeks, it was the most impressive model I had ever used. Goal mode plus this model is pure sorcery. It built me a voxel-based",
      "cover_media": {
        "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHMuaEH8WYAAKAAIQlRmA3NfQAAAA",
        "media_id": "2074921448976572416",
        "media_info": {
          "__typename": "ApiImage",
